WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
Prevent Fires. Never leave cooking unattended. Install smoke alarms where you can.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.950
Get Low. Smoke rises. Crawl low under smoke toward the exit.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.950
Feel Doors. Touch a door with the back of your hand. If it is hot, use another way out.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.950
Stay Out. Once you are out, stay out. Never go back inside for belongings.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.950
Call For Help. Call 911 or the Bureau of Fire Protection from a safe place.

